  "prefLabel": "Pda 503.01 Mooring Permit Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 503.01 Mooring Permit Required. No person shall erect, install, maintain, use, have control over, or set a mooring within the state tidal waters unless a complete mooring permit application has been submitted to the division in accordance with Pda 500 and a mooring permit has been issued by the division.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
